    "http://www.w3.org/2004/02/skos/core#definition": [
      {
        "@language": "en",
        "@value": "Controlled vocabulary of ritual and festival activity types in Kathmandu Valley living heritage."
      }
    ],
    "http://www.w3.org/2004/02/skos/core#editorialNote": [
      {
        "@language": "en",
        "@value": "Design note: RitualType currently mixes three orthogonal axes: worship-frequency (NityaPuja/NaimittikaPuja/KamyaPuja), ritual form (Homa/Jatra/MaskedPerformance), and lifecycle (InstallationRitual/ReturningRitual). Consider splitting into RitualFrequency + RitualForm. Also: Circumambulation/ProcessionalMovement/ProcessionRitual/RelicTour overlap with RitualEvent.hg:routePlaces/hg:startPlace/hg:endPlace/hg:routeDescription -- pick one canonical mechanism for moving rituals."
      }
    ],
