      {
        "@language": "en",
        "@value": "Deprecated in HeritageGraph 1.1.0: a LinkML serialization construct for JSON/YAML data files, not a domain term. It is defined in HeritageGraph-container.yaml and used only by the JSON Schema; RDF instance data should not use it."
