  {
    "@id": "http://www.cidoc-crm.org/cidoc-crm/P140_assigned_attribute_to",
    "@type": [
      "http://www.w3.org/2002/07/owl#ObjectProperty"
    ],
    "http://www.w3.org/2000/01/rdf-schema#isDefinedBy": [
      {
        "@id": "http://www.cidoc-crm.org/cidoc-crm/"
      }
    ],
    "http://www.w3.org/2000/01/rdf-schema#label": [
      {
        "@language": "en",
        "@value": "assigned attribute to"
      }
    ],
    "http://www.w3.org/2004/02/skos/core#definition": [
      {
        "@language": "en",
        "@value": "Quantification: many to many (0,n:0,n)\n\nScope note:\nThis property associates an instance of E13 Attribute Assignment with the instance of E1 CRM Entity about which it made an attribution. The instance of E1 CRM Entity plays the role of the domain of the attribution. \nThe kind of attribution made should be documented using P177 assigned property of type (is type of property assigned).\n\nExamples:\n- The Current Ownership Assessment of Martin Doerr’s silver cup February 1997 (E13) assigned attribute to Martin Doerr’s silver cup (E22). (fictitious)\n- The Identifier Assignment on 1(st) June 1997 of the silver cup donated by Martin Doerr (E15) assigned attribute to silver cup 232 (E22). (fictitious)\n- The examination of MS Sinai Greek 418 (E13) assigned attribute to MS Sinai Greek 418 (E22). (Honey and Pickwoad, 2010)\n\nIn First Order Logic:\n- P140(x,y) ⇒ E13(x)\n- P140(x,y) ⇒ E1(y)"
      }
    ]
  },
  {
    "@id": "https://cair-nepal.org/heritagegraph/SelectionCriterion",
    "@type": [
      "http://www.w3.org/2002/07/owl#Class"
    ],
    "http://www.w3.org/2000/01/rdf-schema#isDefinedBy": [
      {
        "@id": "https://cair-nepal.org/heritagegraph/ontology"
      }
    ],
    "http://www.w3.org/2000/01/rdf-schema#label": [
      {
        "@language": "en",
        "@value": "Selection Criterion"
      }
    ],
    "http://www.w3.org/2000/01/rdf-schema#subClassOf": [
      {
        "@id": "http://www.cidoc-crm.org/cidoc-crm/E55_Type"
      },
      {
        "@id": "http://www.w3.org/ns/prov#Entity"
      }
    ],
    "http://www.w3.org/2004/02/skos/core#broadMatch": [
      {
        "@id": "http://www.cidoc-crm.org/cidoc-crm/E55_Type"
      }
    ],
    "http://www.w3.org/2004/02/skos/core#definition": [
      {
        "@language": "en",
        "@value": "An eligibility criterion a candidate must satisfy to assume the Kumari role. Modelled as explicit subclasses so 'what are the eligibility criteria?' is a subclass query, not free text. Ethics: candidates are children. Criteria describe the tradition; data about how a named or identifiable child met them (bodily marks, health, horoscope) must not be recorded."
      }
    ],
    "http://www.w3.org/2004/02/skos/core#inScheme": [
      {
        "@id": "https://cair-nepal.org/heritagegraph/schema"
      }
    ]
  },
  {
    "@id": "https://cair-nepal.org/heritagegraph/production_events",
    "@type": [
      "http://www.w3.org/2002/07/owl#ObjectProperty"
    ],
    "http://www.w3.org/2000/01/rdf-schema#isDefinedBy": [
      {
        "@id": "https://cair-nepal.org/heritagegraph/ontology"
      }
    ],
    "http://www.w3.org/2000/01/rdf-schema#label": [
      {
        "@language": "en",
        "@value": "obsolete production events"
      }
    ],
    "http://www.w3.org/2002/07/owl#deprecated": [
      {
        "@type": "http://www.w3.org/2001/XMLSchema#boolean",
        "@value": true
      }
    ],
    "http://www.w3.org/2004/02/skos/core#definition": [
      {
        "@language": "en",
        "@value": "Collection of Production event instances."
      }
    ],
    "http://www.w3.org/2004/02/skos/core#editorialNote": [
      {
        "@language": "en",
        "@value": "Deprecated in HeritageGraph 1.1.0: a LinkML serialization construct for JSON/YAML data files, not a domain term. It is defined in HeritageGraph-container.yaml and used only by the JSON Schema; RDF instance data should not use it."
      }
    ],
    "http://www.w3.org/2004/02/skos/core#inScheme": [
