      },
      {
        "@id": "https://cair-nepal.org/heritagegraph/Tenure"
      }
    ],
    "http://www.w3.org/2004/02/skos/core#broadMatch": [
      {
        "@id": "http://www.cidoc-crm.org/cidoc-crm/E4_Period"
      }
    ],
    "http://www.w3.org/2004/02/skos/core#definition": [
      {
        "@language": "en",
        "@value": "Dated period during which an actor (typically a Guthi) holds custody of a heritage structure or object, opened and closed by transfer-of-custody events. Unlike the untimed crm:P50i_is_current_keeper_of, it answers who held custody at a given date."
      }
    ],
    "http://www.w3.org/2004/02/skos/core#editorialNote": [
      {
        "@language": "en",
        "@value": "Design note: PROV placement: a prov:Entity, i.e. a thing whose provenance is tracked (sources, attributions, assertions about it), and a crm:E4_Period (stated, 1.1.0). A period is not a crm:E7_Activity, so the class stays outside any E7 ⊑ prov:Activity alignment and the PROV-O Entity/Activity disjointness is not engaged; reasoning with CIDOC-CRM, CRMinf, CRMsci and PROV-O loaded is consistent with the example data."
      }
    ],
    "http://www.w3.org/2004/02/skos/core#inScheme": [
      {
        "@id": "https://cair-nepal.org/heritagegraph/schema"
      }
    ]
  },
