  {
    "@id": "http://www.cidoc-crm.org/cidoc-crm/P105_right_held_by",
    "@type": [
      "http://www.w3.org/2002/07/owl#ObjectProperty"
    ],
    "http://www.w3.org/2000/01/rdf-schema#isDefinedBy": [
      {
        "@id": "http://www.cidoc-crm.org/cidoc-crm/"
      }
    ],
    "http://www.w3.org/2000/01/rdf-schema#label": [
      {
        "@language": "en",
        "@value": "right held by"
      }
    ],
    "http://www.w3.org/2004/02/skos/core#definition": [
      {
        "@language": "en",
        "@value": "Quantification: many to many (0,n:0,n)\n\nScope note:\nThis property identifies the instance of E39 Actor who holds the instances of E30 Right to an instance of E72 Legal Object.\nIt is a superproperty of P52 has current owner (is current owner of) because ownership is a right that is held on the owned object.\nThis property is a shortcut of the fully developed path from E72 Legal Object, P104 is subject to, E30 Right, P75i is possessed by to E39 Actor.\n\nExamples:\n- The Beatles back catalogue (E73) right held by Michael Jackson (E21). (Raga, 2016)\n\nIn First Order Logic:\n- P105(x,y) ⇒ E72(x)\n- P105(x,y) ⇒ E39(y)\n- P105(x,y) ⇐ (∃z) [E30(z) ˄ P104(x,z) ˄ P75i(z,y)]"
      }
    ]
  },
  {
    "@id": "https://cair-nepal.org/heritagegraph/RitualType#ReturningRitual",
    "@type": [
      "http://www.w3.org/2002/07/owl#NamedIndividual",
      "http://www.w3.org/2004/02/skos/core#Concept",
      "https://cair-nepal.org/heritagegraph/RitualType"
    ],
    "http://www.w3.org/2000/01/rdf-schema#isDefinedBy": [
      {
        "@id": "https://cair-nepal.org/heritagegraph/ontology"
      }
    ],
    "http://www.w3.org/2000/01/rdf-schema#label": [
      {
        "@language": "en",
        "@value": "Returning Ritual"
      }
    ],
    "http://www.w3.org/2004/02/skos/core#definition": [
      {
